        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: American Gothic (novel)\n- People: Robert Bloch, H. H. Holmes, Herman Webster Mudgett, G. Gordon Gregg\n- Topics: psychological horror, serial killers\n\nFacts:\n- Herman Webster Mudgett was born on May 16, 1861.\n- Herman Webster Mudgett was better known as Dr. Henry Howard Holmes or H. H. Holmes.\n- H. H. Holmes was an American serial killer of the 19th century.\n- H. H. Holmes died on May 7, 1896.\n- Robert Bloch published the psychological horror novel American Gothic in 1974.\n- American Gothic is a fictionalized portrayal of the real-life serial killer H. H. Holmes.\n- In American Gothic, H. H. Holmes is renamed G. Gordon Gregg for the story.",
